                                "sense_id": "e28cebea-4461-3111-8299-eaaadee5aaee",
                                "text": "Boris Johnson was accused on Saturday of being “missing in action” after failing to attend a Cobra meeting to discuss the national heatwave emergency following predictions that thousands could die in the coming days."
