                                "sense_id": "e28cebea-4461-3111-8299-eaaadee5aaee",
                                "text": "In the UK, a Cobra security meeting was called and in Estonia, which neighbours Russia, the prime minister, Kaja Kallas, said there was strengthened security on the border."
                            }
